{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07909","headline":"夜泊宣城界 · 孟浩然","name":"夜泊宣城界","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西塞沿江岛，南陵问驿楼。\n湖平津济阔，风止客帆收。\n去去怀前浦，茫茫泛夕流。\n石逢罗刹碍，山泊敬亭幽。\n火识梅根冶，烟迷杨叶洲。\n离家复水宿，相伴赖沙鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}